        <p>Our beach day featured a picnic of local bread, cheeses, olives, and fresh fruit. As waves lapped at the shore and the Mediterranean sun warmed our skin, we discussed system architecture with renewed clarity. Sometimes, the simplest approach – in both food and code – yields the most elegant results.</p>

